  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3cf711bd06ef4f479a2906fc1414ca9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vieja1_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - <color=#FF00FF><sketchy>SONNY!</sketchy></color> You finally arrive. I need your
    aid as soon as possible.
  - (That so called <color=#FF00FF>"Order" </color>sure works fast...)
  - You see... <color=#00FFFF>The town is cursed</color>, by something wicked that
    doesn't want to allow the dead to rest.
  - Your powers as a <color=#FF00FF>Guardian</color> are helpful, but I'm looking
    for a more <shake>(cof, cof)</shake> permanent solution.
  - I need you to make way through <color=yellow>3 different areas</color>, and obtain
    the <color=yellow>ingredients</color> I must have... to perform a <color=yellow>spell
    that could lift the curse</color> forever.
  - Go ahead! There is not much time left, <wave amplitude=2>specially for me...</wave>
